{"unit_id":"hanbernate__dsh-save-button#card-zh","repo":"hanbernate/dsh-save-button","commit":"2b52a80c7361773282dfe7b409864e9ea3559f74","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-save-button（DSH 网页插件）：为 DSH Web 交付卡片添加下载按钮，让 present 声明的文件可由浏览器保存。Host 提供下载路由，客户端根据运行时插槽接入按钮；用户可下载交付文件、查看状态并重试，且保留卡片预览与原有打开操作。适合在远程主机或容器使用 DSH Web、需要将生成文件保存到本机的用户，无需额外密钥或账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:44-65","lib/client.js:630-695"]}
{"unit_id":"hanbernate__dsh-save-button#card-en","repo":"hanbernate/dsh-save-button","commit":"2b52a80c7361773282dfe7b409864e9ea3559f74","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-save-button adds a download button to DSH Web cards for files declared with present. Its Host route serves files through the browser; users can save deliveries, see status and retry. Preview and open actions remain available. It suits remote hosts and needs no key or account.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:44-65","lib/client.js:630-695"]}
